  "zh": "# 中美高层互访与新能源汽车困境成为今日焦点\n## 政治政策\n- **习近平访美国事访问纪实**：习近平此访旨在修复中美关系，释放合作信号。\n- **教育部原副部长鲁昕被查**：教育系统反腐持续深化，警示官僚作风问题。\n## 产业技术\n- **电车买得起修不起**：新能源车售价下降但维修成本高，暴露售后服务短板。\n- **Ember-1 AI模型发布**：Fireworks.ai 推出轻量级多模态模型，降低企业AI门槛。\n- **Llama.cpp提升Prompt查找速度**：通过优化检索结构，大幅提升本地大模型响应效率。\n## 国际社会\n- **俄罗斯反对日本入常**：俄方明确反对日本入常，凸显大国博弈加剧。\n- **中国连续五届世界技能大赛金牌第一**：中国职业教育成果显著，彰显技术人才竞争力。\n- **美国农药致癌化学物质研究**：新研究发现近500种农药与乳腺癌关联，引发公共健康担忧。",
  "en": "# Today’s highlights include high‑level US‑China talks, EV affordability vs. repair costs, and notable AI model releases.\n## Politics & Policy\n- **Xi Jinping US trip**：This visit aims to ease tensions and pave the way for economic dialogue.\n- **Lu Xin graft probe**：Anti‑corruption efforts remain strong, warning the education sector to watch for power‑rent seeking.\n## Industry & Tech\n- **EV cost paradox**：Cars are cheap to buy but expensive to fix, exposing gaps in EV after‑sales support.\n- **Ember-1 AI release**：Fireworks.ai launches a lightweight multimodal model, lowering the barrier for enterprise AI adoption.\n- **Llama.cpp speedup**：Optimized lookup structures greatly boost response speed for local large models.\n## International Society\n- **Russia Japan UNSC**：Russia openly blocks Japan’s bid for a permanent UNSC seat, highlighting reform difficulties.\n- **China Skills gold**：China’s five‑peat WorldSkills gold shows the strength of its vocational training system.\n- **Pesticide cancer**：A study links nearly five hundred pesticides to breast cancer, raising public health concerns."
